{"t":"Piggy Bank","s":"piggy-bank-feae3","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Piggy_Bank_6d079f.gif","q":4,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Piggy Bank</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Piggy Bank\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piggy_Bank_6d079f.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Household Items<br/>Decorations<br/>Party Items</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.50 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">400 - 2,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20051003201725&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piggy_Bank_6d079f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a piggy bank.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 7.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When you use it you usually get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (piggy bank plays <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Yellow Notes Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yellow_Notes_Effect_cf87f5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Yellow Musical Notes), but be careful; it can turn into a Broken Piggy Bank (while <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sparks Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sparks_Effect_23bea4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Sparking), even on the first try, at the same time leaving you a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (and rarely, 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coins</a>). The statistics show that piggy banks have a 20% break rate. This suggests the average value for a piggy bank is 401 gp.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Piggy Bank/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p><p>Reward from the Arena, Greenhorn level.<br/>Reward from <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>.<br/>It can be obtained through Suspicious Surprise Bags, <a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Unrealized%20Dream\">Unrealized Dreams</a>.<br/>After breaking 50 Piggy Banks you will receive the achievement Allowance Collector.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Although this item was implemented in Summer Update 2004, it became obtainable only after Summer Update 2006 when it was added to creatures loot.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Askarak%20Demon\">Askarak Demon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Knight\">Black Knight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cult%20Believer\">Cult Believer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cult%20Enforcer\">Cult Enforcer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cult%20Scholar\">Cult Scholar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enlightened%20of%20the%20Cult\">Enlightened of the Cult</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grandfather%20Tridian\">Grandfather Tridian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Hero</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernalist\">Infernalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Summer\">Izcandar Champion of Summer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Winter\">Izcandar Champion of Winter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Basher\">Lost Basher</a></li>\n<